 "front": "In Lab 1, what are the explained shares of the top three components of the SIMULATED six-tenor panel, in percent to one decimal?",
 "back": "75.9, 18.1 and 5.2 percent, each a share of the total over all six eigenvalues and computed from unrounded eigenvalues (Lab 1 output). These describe one SIMULATED run.",
